> function write_pool_context()
>     mkpath("modelpool/context")
>     path = joinpath("modelpool/context",
>                     "context-$(Dates.format(now(), "yyyymmdd-HHMMSS")).bin")
>     serialize(path, make_pool_context())
>     return abspath(path)
> end
> ```
